      "title": "Qt: Make dragging the Sequence Diagram axis not sticky",
      "message": "Qt: Make dragging the Sequence Diagram axis not sticky\n\nAdd back the axis_pressed_ bool. For some reason (order in which\nsignals are handled?) we can't rely just on the selection status.\n\nSet the pen when the axis base line and ticks are selected to the\nno pen as well, so we don't have the blue line.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-07-02T10:57:44.000-04:00",
